<deadlockability name="Goo Ball" />

'''Goo Ball''' is Viscous's ultimate. He morphs into a massive rolling ball of goo that deals damage and stuns enemies it hits, while gaining bonus move speed and heavy resistances.

== How to use it ==
* Your primary engage and teamfight disruption: roll into the enemy backline to stun and scatter them.
* The resistances make you very hard to kill mid-roll, so dive with confidence and body-block for your team.
* Tier upgrades add damage and resistances, then extra duration and a longer stun.

See the full kit on the [[Abilities]] page.

